SUMMARY:The Last Sunday in June\, Let's Walk at Lake Junaluska
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nGather at 2:00 at Lake Ju
 naluska inside the Bethea Welcome Center. This will be a 7 KM/4 mile route
 . The walk does not just go around the lake\, but through the Nature Garde
 n\, along the Rose Walk\, and up to Lambuth Inn. The view from Inspiration
  Point is a must-see!\n\nDress for the weather. Consider a hat and sunscre
 en. Some people may want walking poles\, especially for the walk up to Lam
 buth Inn\; tennis shoes should be fine. It is particularly important that 
 walkers bring a protein snack and **plenty of** **water**. Restrooms are a
 vailable at the Welcome Center\, at Lambuth Inn\, and along the route. Dog
 s on leash are welcome. Strollers are ok.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314927761/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260523T225036Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260523T225036Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
